&lt;p data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;Lead technical onboarding, configuration, and production deployments for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1308&quot;&gt;strategic enterprise and U.S. Federal customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
