&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;tcv91f&quot; data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2378&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2379&quot; data-end=&quot;2719&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ubgutk&quot; data-start=&quot;2379&quot; data-end=&quot;2515&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2381&quot; data-end=&quot;2515&quot;&gt;Present complex technical concepts to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2419&quot; data-end=&quot;2464&quot;&gt;both executive and technical stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;, tailoring communication to audience and context&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a4ryv7&quot; data-start=&quot;2516&quot; data-end=&quot;2614&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2518&quot; data-end=&quot;2614&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships that drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2557&quot; data-end=&quot;2612&quot;&gt;adoption, expansion, and long-term customer success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
